  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien baseball cheer chant-pop in the Taiwan stadium cheer-squad style. A live cheer-squad bass drum hitting every beat with snare rolls leading into each chant; bright trumpet stabs on the off-beats; an EDM supersaw lead over a sidechained four-on-the-floor kick; handclaps on two and four; the bridge stripped to cheer drum and chant only. Big stadium sound, the cheer drum and the gang vocals forward, crowd-style reverb on the chant, the supersaw wide behind them. A male lead cheer-caller, half-shouted with a megaphone-like midrange, answered by a crowd of young voices chanting each hook back in unison. 140 BPM, D major. Hoarse, proud and laughing at the dean. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no rap verse, no slow ballad section, no brass-band melody, no dubstep drop.",
